    <briefdescription>
<para>Static shader program builder — compiles and links OpenGL shader programs. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Pure static utility following the <ref refid="structjam_1_1view_1_1Manager" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">jam::view::Manager</ref> pattern. No instance state.</para>
<para><ref refid="structshader_1_1_compiler_1a95ea022f07f67cfc5678fe687ae10e0c" kindref="member">build()</ref> takes fragment source strings, loads quad.vert from <ref refid="namespaceBinaryData" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">BinaryData</ref> via <ref refid="structconfig_1_1_file_1_1_shaders" kindref="compound">config::File::Shaders</ref>, compiles, links, returns the program. Caller owns the result.</para>
<para>Thread contract: ALL methods GL THREAD only. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
